      "x": 220,
      "y": 2120,
      "width": 1410,
      "height": 210,
      "color": "#143A8F",
      "text": "## 可观测性\n\nLog · Metric · Trace  \n必须有真实采集出口"
    },
    {
      "id": "cp-boundary",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 220,
      "y": 2390,
      "width": 1410,
      "height": 390,
      "color": "#52667F",
      "text": "### 边界不变量\n\n平台控制面负责创建、配置与治理。  \n它不属于节点层级，也不接管单商城交易状态。"
    },
    {
      "id": "mall-experience",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2070,
      "y": 820,
      "width": 2390,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "#1F5EFF",
      "text": "## 体验层\n\nStorefront · Console · Auth · Miniapp  \nZHU-VI Token · Component · Pattern"
    },
    {
      "id": "mall-contract",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4540,
      "y": 820,
      "width": 2390,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "#1F5EFF",
      "text": "## 唯一合同层\n\nOperations · Capabilities · Errors  \nEvents · Generated SDK"
    },
    {
      "id": "mall-core",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2070,
      "y": 1060,
      "width": 4860,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "#239B56",
      "text": "# Commerce 业务内核｜Mall Core\n\n**身份与组织**　IAM · Organization · Member　　**商品与准备**　Catalog · Pricing · Inventory · Cart · Checkout  \n**交易事实**　OMS · Payment · Finance · Fulfillment　　**增长与运营**　Channel · Referral · Benefit · Voucher · Support · Risk · Audit · Reporting"
    },
    {
      "id": "mall-runtime",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2070,
      "y": 1410,
      "width": 2390,
      "height": 200,
      "color": "#52667F",
      "text": "## 运行层\n\nCommerce API · Application Service · Outbox  \nCommerce Jobs · Provider / Vendor Adapters"
    },
    {
      "id": "mall-data",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4540,
      "y": 1410,
      "width": 2390,
      "height": 200,
      "color": "#E8751A",
      "text": "## Canonical 数据层\n\nPostgreSQL · Cache · Object Storage  \nMigration Ledger · 领域写入边界"
    },
    {
      "id": "flow-order",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2170,
      "y": 1900,
      "width": 2250,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "#1F5EFF",
      "text": "## 订单流\n\n购买意图 → 购物车与结算 → 订单创建  \n→ 订单状态 → 取消或完成 → 售后关系"
    },
    {
      "id": "flow-product",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4580,
      "y": 1900,
      "width": 2250,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "#239B56",
      "text": "## 商品流\n\n商品 → SKU → 价格 → 库存 → 预占或释放  \n→ 履约 → 发货与收货 → 退货"
    },
    {
      "id": "flow-cash",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2170,
      "y": 2170,
      "width": 2250,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "#E8751A",
      "text": "## 现金流\n\n支付请求 → 支付渠道 → 回调与确认  \n→ 实收 → 退款 → 资金状态 → 支付结果"
    },
    {
      "id": "flow-finance",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4580,
      "y": 2170,
      "width": 2250,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "#7A4BC0",
      "text": "## 财务流\n\n应收应付 → 内部账本 → 凭证 → 分配  \n→ 结算 → 对账 → 差异处理"
    },
    {
      "id": "flow-links",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2170,
      "y": 2440,
      "width": 2180,
      "height": 250,
      "color": "#52667F",
      "text": "### 关键跨线关联\n\n结算读取商品与库存事实  \n支付成功形成订单与财务事实  \n售后触发退货、退款与逆向记账"
    },
    {
      "id": "flow-complete",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4470,
      "y": 2440,
      "width": 1060,
      "height": 250,
      "color": "#143A8F",
      "text": "## 四线汇合\n\n**完整交易事实**"
    },
    {
      "id": "flow-rule",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 5650,
      "y": 2440,
      "width": 1180,
      "height": 250,
      "color": "#52667F",
      "text": "### 跨线规则\n\n命令 · 查询 · 领域事件  \n可追踪 · 可重试 · 幂等  \n历史快照不可改写"
    },
    {
      "id": "mall-request-chain",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2070,
      "y": 2840,
      "width": 4860,
      "height": 160,
      "color": "#143A8F",
      "text": "## 唯一请求链　UI → Generated SDK → Commerce API → Application Service → Domain → Repository → Canonical PostgreSQL"
    },
    {
      "id": "thread-iam005a-note",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2470,
      "y": 1620,
      "width": 4060,
      "height": 100,
      "color": "#E5482D",
      "text": "**IAM-005A 路径：** Console → Contract → IAM / Identity / Member → Application / Security → PostgreSQL / Migration　[打开 Codex 任务](codex://threads/01a058b7-6a40-7eb1-9c96-eccea7f12a3c)"
    },
    {
      "id": "replication-core",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 7370,
      "y": 830,
      "width": 1410,
      "height": 210,
      "color": "#E5482D",
      "text": "## 标准商城内核 Mall Core\n\n同一套代码与构建产物"
