    {
      "id": "replication-l0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 7370,
      "y": 1090,
      "width": 660,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "#E5482D",
      "text": "## L0—L5\n\n完整经营商城  \n独立 mall_id"
