    {
      "id": "replication-l1-l11",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8120,
      "y": 1090,
      "width": 660,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "#E5482D",
      "text": "## L6—L11\n\n消费者节点  \n只启用少量消费功能"
    },
    {
      "id": "replication-instance-truth",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 7370,
      "y": 1330,
      "width": 1410,
      "height": 250,
      "color": "#E5482D",
      "text": "## 每个节点独立拥有\n\nnode_id · 身份 · 权限 · 参与事实  \n只有 L0—L5 拥有商城经营范围"
    },
    {
      "id": "replication-isolation",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 7370,
      "y": 1630,
      "width": 1410,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "#E5482D",
      "text": "## 运行边界\n\n商城事实按 mall_id 分舱。  \n消费者事实按节点身份与本人范围分舱。"
    },
    {
      "id": "replication-terms",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 7370,
      "y": 2000,
      "width": 1410,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "#E5482D",
      "text": "## 名词边界\n\n**Mall Product**＝完整产品边界  \n**Mall Scope**＝mall_id 数据范围  \n**MallContext ≠ 商城系统 Mall**"
    },
    {
      "id": "replication-principle",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 7370,
      "y": 2350,
      "width": 1410,
      "height": 390,
      "color": "#52667F",
      "text": "### 永久不变量\n\n共享代码架构不等于十二级全商城。  \nL0—L5 是商城，L6—L11 是消费者。  \n已删除的全商城解释不得恢复。"
    },
